@startuml

title DSA When the Agreement Is Only a Signed PDF
!include ./style.iuml

participant "Provider staff" as M
participant "Publisher site\nand catalogue" as Pub
participant "Provider admin" as Adm
participant "Authorisation server" as AS
participant "Recipient server" as I

autonumber "<b>00:</b>"

M -> Pub : signed PDF, SHA-256,\nDCAT record (P2)
M -> Adm : configure the agreement\nversion (URL + hash)
Adm -> AS : register client; set scopes from the PDF;\nchange record cites URL + hash (P4)
I -> AS : client credentials over mTLS (P5)
AS -> I : access token (static scopes)
note over Adm
  review the log against the PDF;
  expiry reminder;
  disable the client on breach
end note

@enduml
